<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="507116412"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1538286921"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Amazing Trees"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Tielle / SawanoHiroyuki[nZk]"/><amll:meta key="album" value="2V-ALK"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:19.900"><div begin="00:22.650" end="04:19.900"><p begin="00:22.650" end="00:27.820" itunes:key="L1">僕あホコリだけの答えを見つけた顔しながら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我抱着残存的自尊心</span></p><p begin="00:27.820" end="00:33.820" itunes:key="L2">外で本当の言葉を置き忘れていたんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而实际上早已</span></p><p begin="00:33.820" end="00:38.240" itunes:key="L3">裏返しの過去に明かりを照らしてても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">表里不一的过去</span></p><p begin="00:38.240" end="00:43.680" itunes:key="L4">誤魔化したこれまでの声が横で目を覚ます<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">至今为止一直隐瞒的心声</span></p><p begin="00:43.680" end="00:53.940" itunes:key="L5">走り出すのが当たり前だったとうろ覚えな振りを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">必须尽全力奔跑</span></p><p begin="00:53.940" end="00:59.080" itunes:key="L6">時に濡れた道の砂が靴の底に詰まる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时不时鞋底上沾满</span></p><p begin="00:59.080" end="01:04.840" itunes:key="L7">振り落とせば出れる路地<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是用力抖落 便能穿过小巷</span></p><p begin="01:04.840" end="01:06.640" itunes:key="L8">Getting me all upset<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我心烦意乱</span></p><p begin="01:06.640" end="01:10.090" itunes:key="L9">I just wanna be free, I couldn't<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我渴望自由自在</span></p><p begin="01:10.090" end="01:14.190" itunes:key="L10">Truth that I've been hiding, it's so hard to see<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">相信我一直逃避的现实</span></p><p begin="01:14.190" end="01:17.150" itunes:key="L11">You've been getting me all upset<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一直以来 你让我心烦意乱</span></p><p begin="01:17.150" end="01:19.740" itunes:key="L12">I have fallen too far<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已经无法自拔的沦陷其中</span></p><p begin="01:19.740" end="01:22.810" itunes:key="L13">I couldn't grow the way I've been wanting<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不能继续这样下去 我期待已久</span></p><p begin="01:22.810" end="01:24.830" itunes:key="L14">You know who you are<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你了解真实的自我</span></p><p begin="01:24.830" end="01:30.260" itunes:key="L15">We're all amazing trees reaching up to the stars<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们像是触及星空的神奇之树</span></p><p begin="01:30.260" end="01:35.250" itunes:key="L16">Though we're no longer children they sing in our hearts<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们不再是孩子了 他们唱出我们的心声</span></p><p begin="01:35.250" end="01:40.550" itunes:key="L17">We know the time that's passing is not everlasting<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们知道时光流逝 难以永恒</span></p><p begin="01:40.550" end="01:44.700" itunes:key="L18">Stop telling yourself the lies<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要再自欺欺人了</span></p><p begin="01:44.700" end="01:47.810" itunes:key="L19">I wanna change<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想做出改变</span></p><p begin="01:51.560" end="01:56.600" itunes:key="L20">それ外れた祈りをかわしまた後ろに 近づく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">交换已经变形了的愿望</span></p><p begin="01:56.600" end="02:02.390" itunes:key="L21">あの日 出遭った喜びを無邪気に掲げながら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将那日相逢的喜悦</span></p><p begin="02:02.390" end="02:06.960" itunes:key="L22">迷路に似たような 怖さと期待の影<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仿若迷失方向的恐惧和期待的身影</span></p><p begin="02:06.960" end="02:12.380" itunes:key="L23">これが最後みたいな風通るのは街のせいじゃない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">似乎这便是最后一次拂过我身旁的风</span></p><p begin="02:12.380" end="02:22.670" itunes:key="L24">泣き出した日が 立つ未来選んだ スローペースと向き合う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">悲伤哭泣的那天</span></p><p begin="02:22.670" end="02:27.730" itunes:key="L25">焦る月が惑わす空で 通り雨に打たれる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">焦虑的月亮悬挂在困惑的天空</span></p><p begin="02:27.730" end="02:33.520" itunes:key="L26">幼い日々が 直線を歌う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">年少无知的岁月歌唱着青春的无畏</span></p><p begin="02:33.520" end="02:35.370" itunes:key="L27">Getting me all upset<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我心烦意乱</span></p><p begin="02:35.370" end="02:38.760" itunes:key="L28">I just wanna be free, I couldn't<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我渴望自由自在</span></p><p begin="02:38.760" end="02:43.040" itunes:key="L29">Truth that I've been hiding, it's so hard to see<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">相信我一直逃避的现实</span></p><p begin="02:43.040" end="02:45.660" itunes:key="L30">You've been getting me all upset<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一直以来 你让我心烦意乱</span></p><p begin="02:45.660" end="02:48.210" itunes:key="L31">I have fallen too far<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已经无法自拔的沦陷其中</span></p><p begin="02:48.210" end="02:51.460" itunes:key="L32">I couldn't grow the way I've been wanting<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不能继续这样下去 我期待已久</span></p><p begin="02:51.460" end="02:53.580" itunes:key="L33">You know who you are<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你了解真实的自我</span></p><p begin="02:53.580" end="02:58.960" itunes:key="L34">We're all amazing trees reaching up to the stars<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们像是触及星空的神奇之树</span></p><p begin="02:58.960" end="03:03.850" itunes:key="L35">Though we're no longer children they sing in our hearts<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们不再是孩子了 他们唱出我们的心声</span></p><p begin="03:03.850" end="03:09.330" itunes:key="L36">We know the time that's passing is not everlasting<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们知道时光流逝 难以永恒</span></p><p begin="03:09.330" end="03:13.440" itunes:key="L37">Stop telling yourself the lies<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要再自欺欺人了</span></p><p begin="03:13.440" end="03:15.700" itunes:key="L38">I wanna change<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想做出改变</span></p><p begin="03:15.700" end="03:21.080" itunes:key="L39">Amazing trees<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">神奇之树</span></p><p begin="03:21.080" end="03:26.640" itunes:key="L40">空側に眺めた色は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">眺望天空的色彩</span></p><p begin="03:26.640" end="03:36.670" itunes:key="L41">影さえ消えた 混じり気ない old &amp; new<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有一片阴影 澄清透明 新旧交替</span></p><p begin="03:38.690" end="03:40.530" itunes:key="L42">Getting me all upset<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我心烦意乱</span></p><p begin="03:40.530" end="03:44.080" itunes:key="L43">I just wanna be free, I couldn't<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我渴望自由自在</span></p><p begin="03:44.080" end="03:48.210" itunes:key="L44">Truth that I've been hiding, it's so hard to see<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">相信我一直逃避的现实</span></p><p begin="03:48.210" end="03:50.960" itunes:key="L45">You've been getting me all upset<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一直以来 你让我心烦意乱</span></p><p begin="03:50.960" end="03:53.350" itunes:key="L46">I have fallen too far<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已经无法自拔的沦陷其中</span></p><p begin="03:53.350" end="03:56.560" itunes:key="L47">I couldn't grow the way I've been wanting<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不能继续这样下去 我期待已久</span></p><p begin="03:56.560" end="03:58.720" itunes:key="L48">You know who you are<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你了解真实的自我</span></p><p begin="03:58.720" end="04:04.150" itunes:key="L49">We're all amazing trees reaching up to the stars<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们像是触及星空的神奇之树</span></p><p begin="04:04.150" end="04:09.230" itunes:key="L50">Though we're no longer children they sing in our hearts<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们不再是孩子了 他们唱出我们的心声</span></p><p begin="04:09.230" end="04:14.620" itunes:key="L51">We know the time that's passing is not everlasting<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们知道时光流逝 难以永恒</span></p><p begin="04:14.620" end="04:18.740" itunes:key="L52">Stop telling yourself the lies<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要再自欺欺人了</span></p><p begin="04:18.740" end="04:19.900" itunes:key="L53">I wanna change<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想做出改变</span></p></div></body></tt>